                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "44f1b7cc-5341-3861-9c9c-5a287a74d4dc",
                        "entry_id": "b02f7535-49fa-3e32-b52d-b2e3082c06e6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "osoba, która porzuciła swoją religię albo jej przekonania i zasady"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c63abd9b-2a61-4c34-8ceb-f5f85a66920a",
                                "sense_id": "44f1b7cc-5341-3861-9c9c-5a287a74d4dc",
                                "text": "Ostatecznie uznano go za apostatę i wykluczono ze wspólnoty."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3da5fe08-bcb1-4d1e-8f62-b207f0f292fe",
                        "source_entry_id": "b02f7535-49fa-3e32-b52d-b2e3082c06e6",
                        "source_sense_id": "44f1b7cc-5341-3861-9c9c-5a287a74d4dc",
                        "target_lang_word": "apostate",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "apostate",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e7ec1173-8b4d-3b9c-a7c6-8bd1f5e220e9",
                                        "entry_id": "0f714047-979f-3a03-aa83-cdda1868ab91",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Guilty of apostasy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81c64ebe-dd1e-40ac-8512-2efa6c597fa9",
                                                "sense_id": "e7ec1173-8b4d-3b9c-a7c6-8bd1f5e220e9",
                                                "text": "We must punish this apostate priest."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f65e63e1-859f-4256-ab08-cadb04025831",
                                                "sense_id": "e7ec1173-8b4d-3b9c-a7c6-8bd1f5e220e9",
                                                "text": "VVho can impair thee, mighty King, or bound / Thy Empire? eaſily the proud attempt / Of Spirits apoſtat and thir Counſels vaine / Thou haſt repeld, vvhile impiouſly they thought / Thee to diminiſh, and from thee vvithdravv / The number of thy vvorſhippers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f18358c-9031-493f-a41c-3616ccecf556",
                                                "sense_id": "e7ec1173-8b4d-3b9c-a7c6-8bd1f5e220e9",
                                                "text": "a wretched and apostate state"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61097776-8d2d-473e-b064-8f741e287ee1",
                                                "sense_id": "e7ec1173-8b4d-3b9c-a7c6-8bd1f5e220e9",
                                                "text": "An enormous number of monks and priests gave themselves up to sorcery, and there was no lack of apostate priests to perform the ceremonies of the Black Mass."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "apostate",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b230c1ce-a302-3f8d-93b1-61adb5b1f28c",
                                        "entry_id": "f825a780-163b-33a2-8903-cd2e20c86a8b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who has renounced a religion or faith."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b426f645-1df2-3311-9648-6f8dc8f34e31",
                                        "entry_id": "f825a780-163b-33a2-8903-cd2e20c86a8b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who, after having received sacred orders, renounces his clerical profession."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "73185cae-222e-3b98-ad5f-5604da740561",
                                        "entry_id": "f825a780-163b-33a2-8903-cd2e20c86a8b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who has renounced a political party, a cause, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c898c880-96c7-44f8-83c3-57b1a197c1b3",
                                                "sense_id": "73185cae-222e-3b98-ad5f-5604da740561",
                                                "text": "But the most politically damaging blow came from a late-breaking apostate: Mr. Clooney, who just weeks earlier had spent time with Mr. Biden and helped deliver $28 million to his campaign at a Los Angeles fund-raiser."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d304c018-2a6c-4271-a37a-c90388a13d75",
                        "source_entry_id": "b02f7535-49fa-3e32-b52d-b2e3082c06e6",
                        "source_sense_id": "44f1b7cc-5341-3861-9c9c-5a287a74d4dc",
                        "target_lang_word": "apostate",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "apostate",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9730769e-ce64-34df-9cee-caca969a6463",
                                        "entry_id": "95e43dfd-4cd2-3dc2-a980-ae0be336ea29",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Femme ayant abandonné sa religion, qui a fait acte d’apostasie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "689e5d0e-4e4d-404d-964b-9d5780e0e863",
                                                "sense_id": "9730769e-ce64-34df-9cee-caca969a6463",
                                                "text": "Celui-ci lui défendit de reprendre les apostates, de peur qu’elles ne corrompissent par leurs exemples et leurs propos les religieuses demeurées fidèles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38012018-9485-4848-a63b-3c7eb959ae33",
                                                "sense_id": "9730769e-ce64-34df-9cee-caca969a6463",
                                                "text": "Elle a d’abord soutenu que le crucifix n’était pas le sien, que le sien on l’avait volé et qu’elle s’en plaindrait à Joseph dès son retour. Rémi essayait de lui démontrer le contraire, mais, devant la raison butée de l’apostate, levait les bras et, découragé, annonçait qu’il démissionnait."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1ae4ac1-1003-4958-9446-316871f84191",
                                                "sense_id": "9730769e-ce64-34df-9cee-caca969a6463",
                                                "text": "Les juges ont-ils sanctionné le péché d’orgueil qui fit d’elle une obstinée dans la négation, une apostate et une hérétique, en l’envoyant périr dans les flammes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
